sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Handle forms
    %% Stories: 4, 5, 19, 21, 36, 38, 42
    %% Description: The camp administrator creates registration forms and uploads consent forms. Parents sign and submit forms and see what they submitted. The administrator tracks submissions and views medical forms.
    actor AD as Camp administrator
    actor PA as Parent
    participant FO as Form
    participant GD as Guardian
    participant CA as Camper

    %% covers 4, 19
    AD->>FO: create registration forms and upload consent forms
    %% covers 38, 42
    PA->>GD: sign and submit forms online
    GD->>FO: submitted forms
    FO->>CA: camper of the form
    %% covers 36
    PA->>GD: see submitted consent forms
    %% covers 5
    AD->>CA: track submitted forms per camper
    CA->>FO: submitted forms
    %% covers 21
    AD->>FO: view medical forms
